   stage: Metres on an enlarged teaching diagram: origin beneath its centre; x runs left to right, y projects toward the viewer, z is up. The diagram lies at y=0, spans x=-1.1 to 1.1 and z=0.55 to 1.75; cycle-heading is at z=1.95. Off-left absent entries are bookkeeping coordinates, never physical stored objects.; x toward none
   tone: Calm, exact, accessible, and unhurried.
   ambience: Silence; no environmental or apparatus sounds.
   captions: [0s] "Matrix • carbon counts shown on molecular labels"
   line: reaction-loop centre and the rightmost midpoint of inner-membrane; camera side: The exposed-matrix side of inner-membrane, always at positive y.
